ARIA Accessibility Changes Log - Header Module
================================================
Date: 2026-02-11

1. header.component.html
   ---------------------
   - Added role="banner" to the main header container div
   - Added aria-label="GNomEx home" to the logo anchor link
   - Improved logo img alt text to "GNomEx logo - navigate to home"
   - Added aria-label, aria-pressed to the pin/unpin header toggle button
   - Added role="search" and aria-label="Header search" to the search area container
   - Added aria-label="Lookup by experiment number" to the number search input
   - Added aria-label="Search by number" to the number search button; improved alt text
   - Added aria-label="Search by text" to the text search input
   - Added aria-label="Submit text search" to the text search button; improved alt text
   - Added role="alert" and aria-label="Research use disclaimer" to the "FOR RESEARCH ONLY" text
   - Added aria-haspopup="menu" and dynamic aria-label to linkNavItems dropdown buttons
   - Added dynamic [attr.aria-label] to linkNavItems leaf buttons
   - Added dynamic [attr.alt] to all navigation icon images (linkNavItems and navItems)
   - Changed secondary nav bar <div> to <nav> with role="navigation" and aria-label="Main navigation"
   - Added aria-haspopup="menu" and dynamic aria-label to navItems dropdown buttons
   - Added dynamic [attr.aria-label] to navItems leaf buttons

2. menu-item/menu-item.component.html
   -----------------------------------
   - Added role="menu" to the mat-menu element
   - Added aria-haspopup="menu" and dynamic aria-label to branch node submenu buttons
   - Added dynamic [attr.alt] to all menu item icon images
   - Added role="menuitem" and dynamic [attr.aria-label] to leaf node buttons (both callback and routerLink variants)
   - Added role="separator" to the mat-divider element

3. advanced_search/advanced-search.component.html
   -----------------------------------------------
   - Added role="dialog" and aria-label="Advanced Search" to the root container
   - Added aria-label="Search tabs" to the mat-tab-group
   - Added aria-label="General keywords search" to the keywords text input
   - Added aria-label="Search category" to the search type radio group
   - Added aria-label="Field search criteria" to the field search ag-grid
   - Added aria-label="Match type" to the match type radio group
   - Added role="toolbar", aria-label="Filter search results", and aria-live="polite" to the grid results button bar
   - Added dynamic [attr.aria-label] with hit counts to all 6 grid result filter buttons
   - Added aria-label="Search results table" to the search results ag-grid
   - Added role="toolbar", aria-label="Filter tree results", and aria-live="polite" to the tree results button bar
   - Added dynamic [attr.aria-label] with hit counts to all 5 tree result filter buttons
   - Added role="treeitem" and dynamic [attr.aria-label] to tree node template divs
   - Added dynamic [attr.alt] to tree node icon images

