   - Added role="dialog" and aria-label="Manage Links" to the root container
   - Added role="toolbar" and aria-label="Link actions" to the button row
   - Added aria-label="Add new link" to the New button; added alt="New" to its icon
   - Added aria-label="Delete selected link" to the Delete button; added alt="Delete" to its icon
   - Added aria-label="Links table" to the ag-grid element

